gration\nfor Jujutsu, not relying on Git colocation. Unlike other tools on this page,\nVisualJJ is not open-source."},"32":{"id":"/community-tools-30","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#visualjj","content":"Find it here."},"33":{"id":"/community-tools-31","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#jujutsu-ui","content":"jjui is a terminal user interface for working with Jujutsu version control system."},"34":{"id":"/community-tools-32","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#jujutsu-ui","content":"Find it here."},"35":{"id":"/community-tools-33","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#selvejj","content":"Selvejj is a JetBrains plugin for integrating Jujutsu as a first-class VCS within the IDE."},"36":{"id":"/community-tools-34","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#selvejj","content":"Find it here."},"37":{"id":"/community-tools-35","page_id":"/community-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/community-tools#finding-other-integrations","content":"You can find other community contributed tools and integrations in our\nWiki."},"38":{"id":"/faq","page_id":"/faq","type":"page","content":"Frequently asked questions","tags":[],"url":"/faq"},"39":{"id":"/faq-0","page_id":"/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/faq#why-does-my-bookmark-not-move-to-the-new-commit-after-jj-newcommit","content":"Why does my bookmark not move to the new commit after jj new/commit?"},"40":{"id":"/faq-1","page_id":"/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/faq#i-made-a-commit-and-jj-git-push---all-says-nothing-changed-instead-of-pushing-it-what-do-i-do","content":"I made a commit and jj git push --all says \"Nothing changed\" instead of pushing it. What do I do?"},"41":{"id":"/faq-2","page_id":"/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/faq#where-is-my-commit-why-is-it-not-visible-in-jj-log","content":"Where is 