ge_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-5","content":"Emily (@emilazy)"},"3507":{"id":"/changelog-476","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-5","content":"Ilya Grigoriev (@ilyagr)"},"3508":{"id":"/changelog-477","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-5","content":"Nicole Patricia Mazzuca (@strega-nil)"},"3509":{"id":"/changelog-478","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-5","content":"Scott Taylor (@scott2000)"},"3510":{"id":"/changelog-479","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-5","content":"Yuya Nishihara (@yuja)"},"3511":{"id":"/changelog-480","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#release-highlights-3","content":"jj's configuration can now be split into multiple files more easily."},"3512":{"id":"/changelog-481","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#release-highlights-3","content":"jj resolve now accepts built-in tools :ours and :theirs."},"3513":{"id":"/changelog-482","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#release-highlights-3","content":"In colocated repos, newly-created files will now appear in git diff."},"3514":{"id":"/changelog-483","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#release-highlights-3","content":"A long-standing bug relating to empty files in the built-in diff editor was\nfixed. #3702"},"3515":{"id":"/changelog-484","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The minimum supported Rust version (MSRV) is now 1.84.0."},"3516":{"id":"/changelog-485","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The git.push-branch-prefix config has been removed in favor of\ngit.push-bookmark-prefix."},"3517":{"id":"/changelog-486","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"jj abandon no longer supports --summary to suppress the list of abandoned\ncommits. The list won't show more than 10 commits to not clutter the console."},"3518":{"id":"/changelog-487","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"jj unsquash has been removed in favor of jj squash and\njj diffedit --restore-descendants."},"3519":{"id":"/changelog-488","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The jj untrack subcommand has been removed in favor of jj file untrack."},"3520":{"id":"/changelog-489","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The following deprecated revset functions have been removed:"},"3521":{"id":"/changelog-490","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"branches(), remote_branches(), tracked_remote_branches(), and\nuntracked_remote_branches(), which were renamed to \"bookmarks\"."},"3522":{"id":"/changelog-491","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"file() and conflict(), which were renamed to plural forms."},"3523":{"id":"/changelog-492","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"files(x, y, ..) with multiple patterns. Use files(x|y|..) instead."},"3524":{"id":"/changelog-493","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The following deprecated template functions have been removed:"},"3525":{"id":"/changelog-494","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"branches(), local_branches(), and remote_branches(), which were\nrenamed to \"bookmarks\"."},"3526":{"id":"/changelog-495","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#breaking-changes-6","content":"The flags --all and --tracked on jj git push by themself do not cause\ndeleted bookmarks to be pushed anymore, as an additional safety measure. They\ncan now be combined with --deleted instead."},"3527":{"id":"/changelog-496","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#deprecations-6","content":"core.watchman.register_snapshot_trigger has been renamed to core.watchman.register-snapshot-trigger for consistency with other configuration options."},"3528":{"id":"/changelog-497","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#deprecations-6","content":"jj backout is deprecated in favor of jj revert."},"3529":{"id":"/changelog-498","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj sign can now sign with PKCS#12 certificates through the gpgsm backend."},"3530":{"id":"/changelog-499","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj sign will automatically use the gpg key associated with the author's email\nin the absence of a signing.key configuration."},"3531":{"id":"/changelog-500","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"Multiple user configs are now supported and are loaded in the following precedence order:"},"3532":{"id":"/changelog-501","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"$HOME/.jjconfig.toml"},"3533":{"id":"/changelog-502","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/jj/config.toml"},"3534":{"id":"/changelog-503","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/jj/conf.d/*.toml"},"3535":{"id":"/changelog-504","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"The JJ_CONFIG environment variable can now contain multiple paths separated\nby a colon (or semicolon on Windows)."},"3536":{"id":"/changelog-505","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"The command jj config list now supports showing the origin of each variable\nvia the builtin_config_list_detailed template."},"3537":{"id":"/changelog-506","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj config {edit,set,unset} now prompt when multiple config files are found."},"3538":{"id":"/changelog-507","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj diff -r now allows multiple revisions (as long as there are no gaps in\nthe revset), such as jj diff -r 'mutable()'."},"3539":{"id":"/changelog-508","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj git push now accepts a --named NAME=REVISION argument to create a named\nbookmark and immediately push it."},"3540":{"id":"/changelog-509","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"The 'how to resolve conflicts' hint that is shown when conflicts appear can\nbe hidden by setting hints.resolving-conflicts = false."},"3541":{"id":"/changelog-510","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj op diff and jj op log --op-diff now show changes to which commits\ncorrespond to working copies."},"3542":{"id":"/changelog-511","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj op log -d is now an alias for jj op log --op-diff."},"3543":{"id":"/changelog-512","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj bookmark move --to/--from can now be abbreviated to jj bookmark move -t/-f"},"3544":{"id":"/changelog-513","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj bookmark list now supports --sort option. Similar to git branch --sort.\nSee jj bookmark list --help for more details."},"3545":{"id":"/changelog-514","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"A new command jj revert is added, which is similar to jj backout but\nadds the --destination, --insert-after, and --insert-before options to\ncustomize the location of reverted commits."},"3546":{"id":"/changelog-515","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"A new command jj git root is added, which prints the location of the Git\ndirectory of a repository using the Git backend."},"3547":{"id":"/changelog-516","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"In colocated repos, any files that jj considers added in the working copy will\nnow show up in git diff (as if you had run git add --intent-to-add on\nthem)."},"3548":{"id":"/changelog-517","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"Reversing colors is now supported. For example, to highlight words by\nreversing colors rather than underlining, you can set\ncolors.\"diff token\"={ underline = false, reverse = true } in your config."},"3549":{"id":"/changelog-518","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"Added revsets.log-graph-prioritize, which can be used to configure\nwhich branch in the jj log graph is displayed on the left instead of @\n(e.g. coalesce(description(\"megamerge\\n\"), trunk()))"},"3550":{"id":"/changelog-519","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#new-features-6","content":"jj resolve now accepts new built-in merge tools :ours and :theirs.\nThese merge tools accept side #1 and side #2 of the conflict respectively."},"3551":{"id":"/changelog-520","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#fixed-bugs-8","content":"jj log -p --stat now shows diff stats as well as the default color-words/git\ndiff output. #5986"},"3552":{"id":"/changelog-521","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#fixed-bugs-8","content":"The built-in diff editor now correctly handles deleted files.\n#3702"},"3553":{"id":"/changelog-522","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#fixed-bugs-8","content":"The built-in diff editor now correctly retains the executable bit on newly\nadded files when splitting. #3846"},"3554":{"id":"/changelog-523","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#fixed-bugs-8","content":"jj config set/--config value parsing rule is relaxed in a way that\nunquoted apostrophes are allowed.\n#5748"},"3555":{"id":"/changelog-524","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#fixed-bugs-8","content":"jj fix could previously create new conflicts when a descendant of a fixed\nrevision was already correctly formatted."},"3556":{"id":"/changelog-525","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Thanks to the people who made this release happen!"},"3557":{"id":"/changelog-526","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Aleksey Kuznetsov (@zummenix)"},"3558":{"id":"/changelog-527","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Anton Älgmyr (@algmyr)"},"3559":{"id":"/changelog-528","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Austin Seipp (@thoughtpolice)"},"3560":{"id":"/changelog-529","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Baltasar Dinis (@bsdinis)"},"3561":{"id":"/changelog-530","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Benjamin Tan (@bnjmnt4n)"},"3562":{"id":"/changelog-531","page_id":"/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/changelog#contributors-6","content":"Brandon Hall (@tenkabuto)"},"3563":{"id":"/changelog-532","pag